---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---

<!-- Hero section of the home page-->
<section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="label">Season 2026/2027 · Northumbria University</p>
      <h1>This year marks our debut season into <span class="soft">Formula Student.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A new Northumbria team, designed, manufactured, wired and
        run by students at every level, from suspension geometry to the business
        case, over twelve months and one shot at Silverstone.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="#closing">Sponsor Us <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#plan">See the build plan</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="season" id="season" aria-label="Season progress" data-phases="{% for phase in phases %}{{ phase.start }} {% endfor %}{{ site.competition.seasonEnd }}">
      <span class="label">Road to Silverstone</span>

      <div class="season-count">
        <span class="num" id="monthsLeft">{{ (phases | last).start | monthsUntil }}</span>
        <span class="what">
          <span id="monthsWhat">months to go</span>
          <span class="label">FS UK · {{ site.competition.when }}</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="track" aria-hidden="true">
        {% for phase in phases %}
          <span class="seg {% if phase.status == 'now' %}now{% endif %}"></span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <ol class="phase-names">
        {% for phase in phases %}
        <li {% if phase.status == "now" %} class="now" aria-current="step"{% endif %}>{{ phase.short }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- The teams figures such as members, subteams, etc -->

<section class="figures wrap">
  <ul>
    <li class="fig">
      <span class="fig-value">60+</span>
      <span class="fig-label">Members</span>
      <span class="fig-note">Across engineering, business and design.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="fig">
      <span class="fig-value">{{ subteam | length }}</span>
      <span class="fig-label">Sub Teams</span>
      <span class="fig-note"
        >Every part of the car and the campaign behind it.</span
      >
    </li>
    <li class="fig">
      <span class="fig-value">1st</span>
      <span class="fig-label">Season</span>
      <span class="fig-note">Building from nothing in twelve months.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="fig">
      <span class="fig-value fig-value--accent">2027</span>
      <span class="fig-label">Silverstone</span>
      <span class="fig-note">FS UK in July. Our first time on the grid</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- Team photo goes here once the full team photo is taken -->

<!-- Silverstone track -->
<section class="band wrap" id="venue">
  <div class="venue-grid">
    <div class="venue-copy">
      <p class="label">The Venue</p>
      <h2>Silverstone, Northamptonshire</h2>
      <p class="lede">Four days in July. Scrutineering first, because nothing else happens until the car passes it, then the static events and finally the rund that decide the weekend.</p>
      <dl>
        <div><dt class="layout">name</dt><dd>{{ site.competition.name }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="label">Event</dt><dd>{{ site.competition.date }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="venue-art">
    {% include "partials/circuit.svg" %}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- what is formula student -->
<section class="band wrap rule-top" id="about">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-body">
      <div class="head">
        <p class="label">The competition</p>
        <h2>What is Formula&nbsp;Student?</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="first">Formula Student, known as Formula SAE outside Europe, is an international engineering competition in which university teams design, build, test and race a single seater car from scratch.</p>
      <p>It is not only a race. Teams are judged on the engineering behind the car, on the cost and manufacturing plan, and on a business case put to a panel of industry judges, so the competition rewards sound engineering and project management as much as outright speed.</p>
      <p>Universities from across the UK, Europe and the rest of the world compete against cars built the same way: by students, on student budgets, in roughly a year.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="events">
      <div class="ev-group">
        <span class="label">Static events</span>
        <div class="ev-row"><b>Business Plan</b><span class="m">the case for the car as a product</span></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><b>Cost and Manufacturing</b><span class="m">every part, costed and justified</span></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><b>Engineering Design</b><span class="m">defending the design to judges</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ev-group">
        <span class="label">Dynamic events</span>
        <div class="ev-row"><b>Acceleration</b><span class="m">75 m standing start</span></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><b>Skid Pad</b><span class="m">figure of eight</span></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><b>Sprint</b><span class="m">one flying lap</span></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><b>Endurance</b><span class="m">22 km</span></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><b>Efficiency</b><span class="m">energy over the endurance run</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Build Plan -->
<section class="band wrap rule-top" id="plan">
  <div class="head">
    <p class="label">The Season</p>
    <h3>Our Plan</h3>
    <p>Four phases, twelve months, one deadline that does not move.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="phases">
    {% for phase in phases %}
      <article class="phase {% if phase.status %} {{ phase.status }} {% endif %}">
        <span class="when">{{ phase.duration }}</span>
        {% if phase.status == "now" %}
          <span class="label flag">Where we are now</span>
        {% endif %}
        <span>{{ phase.name }}</span>
        <span>{{ phase.summary }}</span>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- partership stuff -->

<!-- cards -->
 {% include "partials/closing.njk" %}

